!!omap
  - id: F028
  - function: DeleteRoomByID
  - range:
      - 502
      - 520
  - args:
      - RoomPtr RoomList
      - int ID
  - return: RoomPtr
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "RoomPtr DeleteRoomByID(RoomPtr RoomList, int ID)\n{\n  RoomPtr current
      = RoomList;\n  RoomPtr previous = NULL;\n\n  while (current != NULL && current->ID
      != ID)\n  {\n    previous = current;\n    current = current->Next;\n  }\n\n\
      \  if (previous == NULL)\n    RoomList = current->Next;\n  else\n    previous->Next
      = current->Next;\n\n  free(current);\n  return RoomList;\n}\n"
  - description: 指定されたIDを持つ部屋をリンクリストから削除し、更新されたリストを返す関数です。
